 # Database Protection Rules

## Core Principles
- Make sure to alert BEFORE a migration will cause a data loss, allow the user to decide whetever he approves or not
- before a migration drops or deletes a table, backup the meta data and the database contents 
- If a column or index is about to be updated / deleted , alert the user as well
- Make sure no delettion or loss of data happens without user approval.
- the backups should be named in the format of [tablename[_[date]_[time].sql
